820 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The unimaginable offspring of Humans and Fiends\054 Tieflings are born with otherworldly physical and mental traits not otherwise seen on Pliara\056 Tieflings first began to appear throughout Pliara less than a year after Deltro\031s Demonic War of 1382\056 Captive Humans began giving birth to wild\054 mostly humanoid figures\054 each reflective in some way of the fiend that they are descended from\056 Although every Tiefling feels the bloodlust and desire for power within their blood\054 each is capable of their own level of free will\056 Despite inner\054 deep\055set desires\054 the descendent of a succubus can grow to become a holy warrior\054 for example\056 Due to their fiendish appearance and general lack of trust from other races\054 Tieflings are mostly found outside of other civilizations\056 Many Tieflings follow a life of adventuring as an escape from the persecution of being a fiend spawn\056\n\nOne of the most aesthetically diverse of all Pliaran races\054 no two Tieflings will ever share the same appearance\056 Not only does a Tiefling often share the diverse facial bone structures of their Human lineage\054 but each trait of fiendish heritage presents itself in a wide variety of ways\056 One Tiefling may develop a long\054 barbed tail and a mouth full of fangs while their sibling manifests wings and yellow eyes\056 Some Tieflings may even present as almost entirely Human\054 with only minor distinctions\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 821 0 R
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

