824 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Charisma score increases by 2\054 and your Intelligence score increases by 1\056\nAge\056 Tieflings mature at the same rate as humans but live a few years longer\056\nAlignment\056 Tieflings might not have an innate tendency toward evil\054 but many of them end up there\056 Evil or not\054 an independent nature inclines many tieflings toward a chaotic alignment\056\nSize\056 Tieflings are about the same size and build as humans\056 Your size is Medium\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 30 feet\056\nDarkvision\056 Thanks to your infernal heritage\054 you have superior vision in dark and dim conditions\056 You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You can\031t discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read and write Common and Infernal\056\n\nDiverse Hellish Heritage\056 Because no two fiendish bloodlines manifest in the same way\054 your Tiefling\031s heritage is modular rather than fixed\056 While all Tieflings share a common Pliaran base\054 the physical traits\054 magical affinities\054 and unnatural resilience passed down from your fiendish ancestor are unique to you\056\n\nWhen creating a Tiefling character\054 you receive a core set of base statistics shared by all of your kin\056 You then receive 3 Fiendish Points \050FP\051 to spend on custom features\054 allowing you to tailor your physical mutations\054 combat defenses\054 and innate powers to match your character\047s distinct lineage\056\n)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 825 0 R
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

825 0 obj
  << /K [ 824 0 R ]
     /P 832 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

826 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Cosmetic Traits \0500 Points\051 \055 Choose up to two\072\nHorns\072 Vestigial\054 massive\054 swept\055back\054 etc\056\nSkin\057Eyes\072 Red\054 blue\054 purple\054 human tones\054 solid color eyes\054 or cat\055like pupils\056\nShort\057Vestigial Tail\072 Non\055functional tail that cannot hold items or strike\056\nHooves \057 Fangs \057 Minor Spines\072 Decorative\054 non\055combat features\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 827 0 R
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

827 0 obj
  << /K [ 826 0 R ]
     /P 832 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

828 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Major Traits \0502 Points Each\051\nBat \057 Fiendish Wings\072 You have a flying speed of 30 feet\056 To use this speed\054 you cannot be wearing medium or heavy armor\056\nFiendish Magic\072 You know one 1st\055level spell from the Fiend Warlock or Sorcerer list \050e\056g\056\054 Hellish Rebuke\054 Burning Hands\054 Disguise Self\051\056 You can cast it once per long rest without a spell slot\054 or using any spell slots you have\056\nSpined Defense\072 Whenever a creature hits you with a melee attack while within 5 feet of you\054 you can use your reaction to deal 1d6 piercing damage to the attacker\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 829 0 R
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

829 0 obj
  << /K [ 828 0 R ]
     /P 832 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

830 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Minor Traits \0501 Point Each\051\nPrehensile Tail\072 Your tail is long and flexible\056 You can hold and manipulate objects weighing up to 5 lbs\054 draw or stow an item\054 or open unlocked doors with it\056 It cannot wield weapons or shields\056\nBarbed Tail \057 Claws\072 You possess natural weapons\056 Unarmed strikes deal 1d4 piercing or slashing damage instead of bludgeoning\056\nHellish Resistance\072 You have resistance to Cold\054 Fire\054 Poison\054 or Acid damage\056 \nNoxious Odor\072 As a bonus action\054 you emit a foul sulfurous stench\056 Each creature within 5 feet of you must succeed on a Constitution saving throw DC \0508 \053 your Proficiency Bonus \053 your Constitution modifier\051 or take 1d4 poison damage and have disadvantage on the next attack roll it makes before the start of your next turn\056 You can use this a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus per long rest\056\nFiendish Resilience\072 You gain resistance to cold weather environments and advantage on saving throws against disease and non\055magical toxins\056\nFiendish Skill\072 You gain proficiency in one of the following skills\072 Deception\054 Intimidation\054 Persuasion\054 or Stealth\056\nHellish Legacy \050Utility\051\072 You learn one cantrip of your choice from the Sorcerer or Warlock spell list\056 Charisma is your spellcasting ability\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 831 0 R
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

